'''ALOLA!''' is the first opening theme for the Korean dub of ''[[Pokémon the Series: Sun & Moon]]''. It debuted with [[SM001]], replacing [[Remember times]] of ''[[Pokémon the Series: XY]]''. Unlike previous Korean opening themes, it uses various episode clips from ''Pokémon the Series: Sun & Moon'', containing no footage from its corresponding Japanese opening theme, [[Alola!!]]. It was replaced by an arrangement of [[Start of an Adventure (song)#Opening animation: SM OP 2|Start of an Adventure]] in [[SM033]] and returned from [[SM044]] to [[SM068]].

A [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=40pmwyxdIa8 teaser for the song] was uploaded to the official Korean Pokémon YouTube channel on March 1, 2017 to promote the [[Pokémon Sun and Moon]] games. The [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Kpd8IFadHHk full music video] for that version was later uploaded on March 24, 2017. The [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mJf3mpdsjoQ version used in the animated series] was uploaded on April 12, 2017 and [https://youtu.be/IriVSHEvNMs again] on May 17, 2017. The [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=G48-FdX9uIs second version used in the animated series] was uploaded on April 18, 2018.

The full version was also used as an insert song at the end of [[SM146]].

==Opening animation: Version 1 ([[SM001]] – [[SM032]])==
===Synopsis===
{{Ash}} and {{AP|Pikachu}} are briefly seen in an {{DL|Transportation in the Pokémon world|Airplanes|airplane}} before the scene changes to show several {{OBP|Pokémon|species}} including {{rf|Alolan}} {{p|Exeggutor}} and {{p|Milotic}}. Ash and Pikachu are then seen enjoying a {{pkmn2|ride}} on {{p|Sharpedo}}. The scene then changes to show [[Melemele Island]] and the series logo appears moments later.

Ash is seen running up a path. Then, his classmates, {{an|Lillie}}, {{an|Mallow}}, and {{an|Lana}} smile. The camera then briefly shows {{p|Rowlet}}, {{p|Litten}}, and {{p|Popplio}}. [[Hala]] laughs and then the [[Rotom Pokédex]] is shown.

The scene then quickly jumps through several scenes including Ash, {{an|Professor Kukui}}, {{ashfr|Ash's classmates}}, Alolan Exeggutor, and {{p|Bounsweet}}.

Rotom Pokédex is seen showing the regional forms of {{p|Persian}}. Then, {{an|Kiawe}} is seen riding on Charizard, and Mallow on Tauros.

[[Jessie]], [[James]], {{MTR}}, and {{TP|Jessie|Wobbuffet}} are introduced, and then {{TP|Jessie|Mimikyu}} is seen deflecting Pikachu's {{m|Electro Ball}}. Next, Ash and Pikachu are using a [[Z-Move]].

Then, during the night, Ash is shown receiving an [[Electrium Z]] from {{DL|Guardian deities (anime)|Tapu Koko}}. Pikachu then jumps onto Ash's shoulders. The scene then shows each of Ash's classmates briefly, before they all run out. Ash and Pikachu are alone, and the camera pans out.

