==Opening animation: Version 2 ([[SM044]] – [[SM068]])==
===Synopsis===
Ash is seen running up a path with Pikachu. Ash is exhausted and down as his classmates approach him to cheer him up, as all are shown with their Pokémon. Everyone is sliding down the spiral slide, but crash into one another after reaching the bottom and colliding with the Alolan Exeggutor, but get back up and dance.

Ash picks up [[Ash's Solgaleo|Nebby]], causing it to cry. {{TRT}} looks around with the background changing each time they move, including their food truck, [[Aether Paradise]], and the [[Altar of the Sunne]]. Ash and his friends are marching down the path in a row as [[Samson Oak]] tries to join with a dance, but is hit and knocked away by a {{p|Komala}}.

Ash and his classmates command their Pokémon to use moves. {{an|Lusamine}}, [[Wicke]], and {{an|Faba}} walk along a bridge inside Aether Paradise while {{an|Professor Burnet}} emerges from a pond underneath. {{an|Gladion}} appears with {{p|Type: Null}} which then [[Evolution|evolves]] into {{TP|Gladion|Silvally}}. Next, Lillie appears in her "Z-Powered form".

Ash commands Pikachu to run and use {{m|Iron Tail}} on Mimikyu. Pikachu continues running and uses {{m|Thunderbolt}} on {{p|Yungoos}}, {{p|Salandit}}, and {{p|Rattata}}, then runs alongside {{p|Solgaleo}}. The scene instantly changes and Ash is with {{p|Tapu Koko}}, who flies off towards the moon and seconds later {{p|Lunala}} flies away from it.

Ash and Pikachu use their Z-Move, {{m|10,000,000 Volt Thunderbolt}}. At the [[Pokémon School]], Ash and Pikachu look at the campus over the balcony in amazement. Ash is sitting on the roof of {{an|Professor Kukui}}'s house looking out towards the ocean with Pikachu and Rotom.

